      <slug></slug>
      <title>Building Server Applications using Objective-C and GNUstep</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>GNUstep + OpenGroupware + Etoile</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This presentation introduces server application development using Objective-C and GNUstep.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;GNUstep provides a full, mature environment for building large-scale &amp;#34;enterprise&amp;#34; server software in Objective-C.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The talk introduces the various components and discusses how to best take advantage of them in real-world projects.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
